  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie i hur utv&#xE4;rderingar finansierade av Sidas avdelningar anv&#xE4;nds b&#xE5;de av Sida och, framf&#xF6;rallt, av intressenter i Sidas samarbets- l&#xE4;nder. Studien skall ocks&#xE5; kartl&#xE4;gga hur olika intressenter deltar i utv&#xE4;rderingsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on how evaluations financed by Sida&apos;s departments are used both by Sida and, putting an emphasis on, partners in developing countries. The study is also to map how various stakeholders participate in the evaluation process.</narrative>
  </description>
